   Add more tests for the following scenarios.
   1. REPL LOAD fails after replicating table or partition objects with stats but before setting last replId. Now, retry which takes alter table/partition replace flows and stats should be valid after successful replication. Need this for all non-transactional, transactional and migration cases.
