{{{color:#205081}public Read<T> withPassword(ValueProvider<String> password) {{color} }}

Otherwise, the current withPassword() method that expects a String parameter forces the use of the ValueProvider getter (and therefore the serialization of the raw password on the staging location), isn't it?

{color:#205081}{{.withPassword(encryptedPassword.get())}}{color}

Did I miss something ?

