Set to

{{-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib}}

instead of

{{-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=$ARROW_HOME/lib}}

Like:
{code:java}
python crossbow.py submit -r kszucs/arrow -v 0.12.0 conda-linux-py27

