 Review comment:
   @mikepigott Could you please help me understand the issue that you are facing..

   From my understanding there should not be a need to set nulls explicitly (since the validity buffer should be off to be begin with and is set to on as we set new values).

   You can use the setPosition() method in the Writer to move the position to forward to ignore nulls from what i understand.

